WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:02.377
Do you want to do something that makes you feel alive?

00:00:02.377 --> 00:00:04.295
(Excited screaming)

00:00:04.295 --> 00:00:07.007
Now that I beat cancer, I'm done letting fear

00:00:07.007 --> 00:00:08.341
stop me from living.

00:00:08.341 --> 00:00:16.975
(Hayley Kiyoko singing)

00:00:16.975 --> 00:00:19.019
I am playing Ella McCaffrey.

00:00:19.102 --> 00:00:20.228
Now that treatment's over.

00:00:20.228 --> 00:00:24.774
She knows that you have to live life to the fullest
because you only get one chance.

00:00:25.608 --> 00:00:27.944
I think I crossed, like, ten things off my bucket list
today.

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:31.781
Cannonball!

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:34.993
This show is about growing from
something that is traumatic and something that's hard.

00:00:35.368 --> 00:00:36.953
That's the thing that inspires us.

00:00:36.953 --> 00:00:41.249
An emotional time in your life doesn't necessarily
need to break you. It could make you into something better.

00:00:41.291 --> 00:00:43.334
I'm not wasting my chance at life.

00:00:43.835 --> 00:00:47.756
You are the toughest 13 year old I've ever known.

00:00:47.756 --> 00:00:50.425
(Music playing)

00:00:50.884 --> 00:00:53.136
Kai is my best friend in the show.

00:00:54.012 --> 00:00:57.849
Kai is this loving, very funny, best friend of Ella's.

00:00:58.058 --> 00:00:59.768
I've always got your back.

00:00:59.768 --> 00:01:01.019
She's doing something.

00:01:01.019 --> 00:01:02.520
I'm right there with her.

00:01:02.520 --> 00:01:05.774
I'm going to hit the stairs. 
Kai, we're in this together.

00:01:05.815 --> 00:01:10.987
Ella's trying to teach Kai how to not be scared
because she used to be the same way that Kai was.

00:01:11.029 --> 00:01:11.863
Do you want to go again?

00:01:12.822 --> 00:01:14.699
Absolutely.

00:01:14.866 --> 00:01:16.701
Ella! You're here!

00:01:16.701 --> 00:01:19.037
Ella: Hey, Ximena.
Ximena: I missed you so much.

00:01:19.245 --> 00:01:24.501
Ximena was Ella's best friend before cancer,
and they were so close. 

00:01:24.501 --> 00:01:27.796
When Ella got cancer., Ximena wasn't really there for her.

00:01:27.796 --> 00:01:31.216
It made Ella feel like Ximena didn't care about her
when that wasn't actually the truth.

00:01:31.424 --> 00:01:35.136
She felt really bad, and she was trying to do
all the things that they used to do as a kid, but

00:01:35.178 --> 00:01:37.222
she had to work on herself a little bit.

00:01:40.016 --> 00:01:42.310
I love Ella's family.
Photobomb!

00:01:43.436 --> 00:01:46.064
Grady, my brother, he's a little nut.

00:01:46.689 --> 00:01:50.110
I may or may not have half a hanger stuck in my cast.

00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:52.278
Grady, you know, he used to love his life,

00:01:52.612 --> 00:01:55.907
but then as soon as she got
sick, all the attention went to Ella.

00:01:56.407 --> 00:01:58.660
I think I've had enough of this....Ella-bration.

00:01:58.660 --> 00:02:01.454
So he uses bad behavior to get attention.

00:02:03.081 --> 00:02:04.124
Hey, Dad.

00:02:04.749 --> 00:02:08.128
He and his family decided that he's going to be
the one that stays at home to help her heal.

00:02:08.253 --> 00:02:10.255
He can be a little too "helicopter-y"

00:02:10.255 --> 00:02:12.048
I can't breathe.

00:02:12.048 --> 00:02:14.592
He wants to make sure that she stays healthy and safe.

00:02:15.093 --> 00:02:17.679
Seriously, Dad? Is that a laminated card

00:02:17.679 --> 00:02:18.930
with all of my allergies?

00:02:18.930 --> 00:02:20.265
And your blood type.

00:02:21.224 --> 00:02:23.601
Mom?

00:02:23.601 --> 00:02:24.060
Hey!

00:02:24.644 --> 00:02:28.940
What I love about Joanne
is she lets Ella make her own decisions.

00:02:28.940 --> 00:02:30.358
Mom...save me.

00:02:30.358 --> 00:02:32.068
Carl, let her be a kid.

00:02:32.735 --> 00:02:38.032
She tries her best to really express support,
but let Ella find her own way.

00:02:38.533 --> 00:02:39.492
What do you want to do?

00:02:39.492 --> 00:02:41.035
I want to make some new memories.

00:02:41.035 --> 00:02:44.038
(Hayley Kiyoko music plays)

00:02:44.038 --> 00:02:48.751
The show has taught me so much
about not being afraid of the what ifs in life.

00:02:48.751 --> 00:02:51.129
(Hayley Kiyoko sings)

00:02:51.129 --> 00:02:52.881
You don't want to have any of those regrets.

00:02:52.881 --> 00:02:54.757
Like, I wish that I wasn't scared to do that.

00:02:54.757 --> 00:03:01.264
(Hayley Kiyoko music plays)

